 "where_the_evidence_runs_out": "The sanctions-to-securities chain is only as long as the published identifiers. In this index 1880 clusters join a sanctions listing to a GLEIF LEI and 25 join an LEI to an SEC CIK, but 0 join all three: no published mapping connects these particular sanctioned legal entities to an SEC filer, so the 13F leg does not fire. That is a gap in the published evidence, not an assertion that no such holding exists.",
