 "what_this_does_not_establish": [
  "Not a sanctions determination. A listing applies to the named party on the named list; membership of a corporate group does not transfer it.",
  "Identity here is asserted by publishers sharing an LEI value, not inferred from names. Where a sanctions record publishes no LEI, absence of a link is absence of published evidence.",
